---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Research & Innovation
subtitle: Driving computational discoveries through interdisciplinary inquiry, faculty scholarship, and student innovation.
permalink: /research.html
metaDescription: Research and development at RV University Department of Computer Applications including publications, patents, sponsored projects, and corporate collaborations.
---

<section class="section section-white">
  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- 4 Key Research Metric Cards -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 4.5rem;">
      {% for card in research.stats %}
        <div class="card" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--color-primary); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              {{ card.count }}
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">{{ card.title }}</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
              {{ card.description }}
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="{{ card.actionLink }}" class="btn btn-outline-teal btn-sm" style="align-self: flex-start;">
            {{ card.buttonText }} ↓
          </a>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <!-- Research Thrust Areas -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4.5rem;">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Thrust Areas</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Core Research Domains</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Our faculty and student research cohorts focus on high-impact interdisciplinary fields.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
        {% for area in research.thrustAreas %}
          <div class="card" style="background-color: var(--bg-muted);">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">{{ area.title }}</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0;">
              {{ area.summary }}
            </p>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Publications Showcase Section (Real Anchor target) -->
    <div id="publications-list" style="margin-bottom: 4rem; scroll-margin-top: 100px;">
      <div class="section-header section-header-left">
        <span class="section-label">Indexed Scholarship</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Selected Recent Publications</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Representative peer-reviewed papers authored by department faculty and scholars.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
        {% for paper in research.samplePapers %}
          <div class="card" style="padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem;">
            <div style="max-width: 750px;">
              <span class="gallery-category-badge" style="margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">{{ paper.badge }}</span>
              <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">{{ paper.title }}</h4>
              <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">{{ paper.authors }} • <em>{{ paper.journal }}</em></div>
            </div>
            <a href="https://scholar.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline-teal btn-sm">
              View via Scholar ↗
            </a>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sponsored Projects & Collaborations (Real Anchor Targets) -->
    <div id="projects-list" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; scroll-margin-top: 100px;">
      <div class="card" id="patents-list">
        <span class="section-label">Patents & Intellectual Property</span>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Technology Inventions</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Faculty and undergraduate teams regularly file invention disclosures with the Indian Patent Office, covering IoT edge telemetries, computer vision classifiers, and cryptographic key distribution mechanisms.
        </p>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600;">25+ National & International IP Filings</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" id="collaborations-list">
        <span class="section-label">Collaborative Ecosystem</span>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Industry & Academic MoUs</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Formal Memorandums of Understanding with Cisco Networking Academy, AWS Academy, Microsoft Learn, and indigenous technology incubators enabling joint research and hackathons.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-outline-teal btn-sm" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Initiate Research Collaboration →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
